    "background_story": "Veda was a brilliant archaeologist with a passion for uncovering the secrets of the ancient world. Growing up, she was fascinated by the stories of Alexandria, the fabled city of knowledge and wisdom. As she delved deeper into her studies, Veda became determined to follow in the footsteps of the great scholars who once walked the streets of Alexandria. She spent years excavating sites in Egypt, searching for clues about the city's lost library. Her tireless efforts finally paid off when she stumbled upon a hidden chamber deep within the ruins of a ancient temple. Inside, she found a cache of scrolls and texts that shed new light on the history of Alexandria. Veda's groundbreaking discovery sparked a new wave of interest in the city's rich cultural heritage, cementing her reputation as a leading expert in the field.",
